<!-- Metro-style collage icon for Welcome panel (page 0). Exact spec from landing mock: two tiles, one dark blue with a photo mosaic inside, one medium blue with a portrait. Strokes are square caps/mitters; fills are your Deepix/Metro palette. -->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
